    "title": "<p>Typical immunohistochemical profiles of primary and secondary carcinomas involving the ovary</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Anna Yemelyanova",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGridLight\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"0\" width=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 3.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Primary site of origin</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 605.75pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"803\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong>Immunohistochemical markers</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 3.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 87.1pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"116\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong>CK7</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong>CK20</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong>SATB2</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.4pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong>SMAD4 (DPC4)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong>p16</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong>PAX8</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong>ER/PR</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Ovarian</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 87.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"116\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+<br />(CK7&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;CK20)<sup>a</sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+/&minus;<br />(~75% are +)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;&nbsp;/ focal, patchy&nbsp;+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Endometrioid: +</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Mucinous: &minus;/+ (focal in ~50% of cases)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Endometrioid: +</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Mucinous: &minus;/+ (~50% of cases)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Colorectal</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 87.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"116\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;<br />(~90% of cases)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+<br />(CK20&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;CK7)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+<br />(~75% of cases; strong, diffuse)<sup>b</sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+/&minus;<br />(loss in up to 20% of cases)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;&nbsp;/ focal&nbsp;+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Appendiceal</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 87.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"116\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;<br />(~70&ndash;90% of cases)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+<br />(CK20&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;CK7)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;&nbsp;/ focal&nbsp;+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Pancreatobiliary</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 87.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"116\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+<br />(CK7&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;CK20)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+<br />(~80% of cases)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;<br />(~50% of cases)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;&nbsp;/ focal&nbsp;+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Gastric</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 87.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"116\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+/&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+/&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;<br />(~95% of cases)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;&nbsp;/ focal&nbsp;+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Endocervical, HPV-associated</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 87.1pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"116\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+<br />(CK7&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;CK20)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;/+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Diffuse&nbsp;+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+, often weak</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;/+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Endocervical, HPV-independent</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 87.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"116\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;/+<br />(~50% of cases)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+<sup>c</sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;&nbsp;/ focal&nbsp;+</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Diffuse in rare cases</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+<br />(~70% of cases)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;<br />(~90&ndash;95% of cases)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 92.15pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"127\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Breast<sup>d</sup></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 87.1pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"116\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">+</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">n/a</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.4pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">n/a</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"114\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">n/a</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">&minus;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 86.45pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"115\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">Often +</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">n/a, not applicable.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup>a</sup>Rare primary ovarian mucinous tumours of teratomatous origin are CK7-negative/CK20-positive <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{17527072}</span>.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup>b</sup>Absence of SATB2 expression in colorectal adenocarcinoma is associated with mismatch repair deficiency and <em>BRAF</em> mutation <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{30001238}</span>.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup>c</sup>Loss of SMAD4 (DPC4) has been reported in a rare case of gastric-type endocervical adenocarcinoma <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{26617929}</span>.</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup>d</sup>Breast carcinomas are usually also positive for GATA3, mammaglobin, and GCDFP-15 and negative for WT1.</p>",
